OL,3,GNEWSACity market shortlisted for
OL,4,Aarchitecture award
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford's Darley Street Market has
OL,7,Fbeen shortlisted for a prestigious
OL,8,Farchitecture award, as it marks the
OL,9,Ffirst anniversary of its opening.
OL,11,FThe Bradford Council-run market has
OL,12,Fbeen nominated alongside six other
OL,13,Fprojects in the Leisure category of the
OL,14,FArchitects' Journal Awards 2026.
OL,16,FThe three-storey market, which cost
OL,17,F#31m, is made up of a fresh food floor,
OL,18,Fa non-food floor and Darley Street
OL,19,FKitchen ` a floor featuring street food
OL,20,Fvendors that regularly hosts live music
OL,21,Fand events.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
