OL,3,GNEWSACity market shortlisted for
OL,4,Aarchitecture award
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreig & Stephenson Architects, which
OL,7,Fdesigned the facility, said the
OL,8,Fnomination was "fantastic recognition
OL,9,Ffor the project and everyone involved".
